      <description>React iframe Portal shell (feature flag show-react-portal-poc), Regression env. Corrected 9/22/2026 — per the "Portal Environments" Confluence page (Portal Team space, actively maintained), the reg deployment URL is regression.primerevenue.com, not access-reg.primerevenue.com (that was a stale URL pulled from a 3-month-old bug ticket; the env was migrated off it per that page's completed DevOps checklist). Requires VPN/Tailscale to reach from outside the office network. NOT YET CONFIRMED LIVE — flagged by Danniecia 9/22 that the old URL didn't load; this replacement is unverified pending a real test.</description>
